			<heading>A Song of Ascents.</heading>
			<begin-paragraph/>
			<v n="1">
				Out of 
				<crossref let="b" cid="c191301.1"/>
				 the depths I have cried to you, Yahweh.
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19130002"/>
			<v n="2">
				Lord, hear 
				<crossref let="c" cid="c191302.1"/>
				 my voice.Let your ears be attentive to the voice of my petitions.
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19130003"/>
			<v n="3">
				If you, 
				<crossref let="d" cid="c191303.1"/>
				 Yah, kept a record of sins,Lord, who could stand?
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19130004"/>
			<v n="4">
				But there 
				<crossref let="e" cid="c191304.1"/>
				 is forgiveness with you,therefore you are feared.
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19130005"/>
			<v n="5">
				I wait 
				<crossref let="f" cid="c191305.1"/>
